WEBVTT

00:07:59.597 --> 00:08:04.966
Cfare tip gruaje po pergatis ta nxjerr ne bote?

00:08:04.966 --> 00:08:08.383
Vetem se nje baba eshte i burgosur

00:08:08.383 --> 00:08:11.433
nuk do te thote qe duhet te jete i perjashtuar

00:08:11.433 --> 00:08:13.984
nga jeta e se bijes.

00:08:13.984 --> 00:08:25.737
(Duartrokitje)